nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯Marvis上线Coding管家，支持手机远程调用CodeBuddy与Kimi Code Desktop</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">百度升级AI搜索及搜索AI API，调用价格降至4.9元/千次</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Neuralink脑机接口重大升级：Grok接入大脑实现意念唤醒与操控</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini升级：支持PDF、表格及代码文件在聊天窗口内联编辑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌Gemini人工智能助手迎来重大功能升级，正式支持在聊天界面内对生成的文件进行直接修改，实现了“生成-修改”的完整闭环。此次更新覆盖了PDF、谷歌文档、谷歌表格、演示文稿、Markdown、TXT及各类代码文件。其中，PDF预览与编辑功能已同步登陆网页端与移动端，其余格式目前主要支持网页端操作。用户现在可全屏打开文档进行精细编辑，或通过选中特定文本直接向Gemini发起提问及下达修改指令，例如将表格一键转换为图表。此次更新将编辑能力直接内嵌至Gemini独立聊天界面，无需跳转外部应用或依赖Workspace侧边栏，显著提升了办公与内容创作的交互效率。随着对话式AI助手相继补齐内联编辑短板，AI作为生产力工具的边界正被进一步拓宽。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，支持8人同时识别</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式开源语音转录大模型Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe，该模型采用混合专家模型（MoE）架构，总参数量340亿，每次前向传播激活43亿参数。其核心优势在于强大的多说话人分离能力，最多可同时区分8名说话人并实时判定声音归属。模型支持40种语言转录及31种语言与英语的双向互译，单次可处理长达1小时的连续音频。在性能表现上，该模型在Open ASR英语组评测中词错误率（WER）低至5.33%，在Artificial Analysis非流式测试中WER进一步降至2.8%，位居开源榜单首位。Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe的发布为开发者提供了处理长音频、会议纪要及跨国交流场景的高效基座，显著提升了复杂语音环境下的识别准确率与处理效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯Marvis上线Coding管家，支持手机远程调用CodeBuddy与Kimi Code Desktop</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c0153e4503ef91d314df0659b2fbf2c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">10月29日，腾讯AI管家Marvis正式上线“Coding管家”，通过手机遥控电脑能力，实现对桌面端AI编程工具的远程调用。该功能首批支持CodeBuddy IDE（编程模式）与Kimi Code Desktop，旨在解决用户离开电脑后无法跟进长线AI编程任务的痛点。用户在Marvis移动端通过“手机遥控电脑”入口授权连接后，即可同步查看项目列表与聊天记录，并利用自然语言发送指令、上传文件或照片，相关操作与对话将实时同步至电脑端。为保障远程任务执行，Marvis电脑端同步提供防休眠功能，确保设备持续在线。此次更新将Marvis的服务场景从基础的电脑、文件、软件及浏览器管理，进一步延伸至AI编程领域，通过原生入口替代传统的桌面远程控制，提升了移动端处理复杂编程任务的交互效率与便捷性，未来该功能还将适配更多AI编</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度升级AI搜索及搜索AI API，调用价格降至4.9元/千次</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/832677c3abf303c4a95b4b9406abe79c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度正式宣布升级百度AI搜索及搜索AI API，旨在拓展应用场景并降低开发者接入成本。核心调整包括搜索AI API推出优惠活动，调用价格低至4.9元/千次。百度App端四大功能同步升级：文心助手从“一次问答”转向“一份交付”，覆盖170余种场景；AI镜头新增动态追踪并支持9种方言实时对话；GUI互动场景数据接入规模提升5倍，涵盖超50亿条数据；AI互动应用新增AI互动剧等内容。此次升级标志着百度AI搜索正从单一检索工具向任务交付、实时交互及内容消费的综合服务形态演进。通过大幅降低API调用门槛，百度意在加速AI搜索能力在企业级应用及第三方产品中的落地，推动行业生态的进一步扩展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Neuralink脑机接口重大升级：Grok接入大脑实现意念唤醒与操控</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4346e49eb882ea8c7f9302488390c497.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Neuralink近日完成重大技术升级，成功将AI模型Grok接入人类大脑，使患者能够通过意念直接唤醒并操控AI智能体。在针对渐冻症患者Kenneth的72小时闭关开发中，团队推出了8项关键技术原型。核心功能包括：Neural VAD（神经语音活动检测）实现零按键意念触发；实时神经信号可视化辅助患者进行闭环反馈训练；系统级脑机输入法与iOS锁屏联动，支持无障碍交互。最显著的突破在于Grok智能体的接入，患者默念指令即可唤醒Grok接管电脑操作，将单一意念转化为复杂行为。此外，团队还实现了脑机解码语音与iPhone通话麦克风的音频流对接，助力患者通过意念完成通话。此次升级标志着脑机接口从单纯的信号捕捉迈向人机协同的新阶段，通过AI托管繁琐操作，有效解决了脑机接口带宽限制的瓶颈，让“想到即做到”成为现实。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
